{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:408cbcde0c5bdc3f","name":"Melee Duelist Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-408cbcde0c5bdc3f","title":"Melee Duelist Talent Tree","revision":19253,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:36:14Z","sha256":"21fa973c74ba9904d982228acd9cbf4f6b75a1b9562c9671601f3f3c4692badf","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19253","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Melee%20Duelist%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-408cbcde0c5bdc3f","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are lethal when fighting with one or more melee weapons.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Advantageous Strike"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You take advantage of your opponent's haste. You gain a +5 bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"}," with melee weapons you are proficient with.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Dirty Tricks"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are not above using a few dirty tricks to win. You can use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feint"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feint","referenceId":"reference:82a1660a47a16b62"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," skill as two ",{"tag":"a","